CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* template template parameter: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* variadic: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* default argument: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [temp.param]/1: the type-parameter-key of a template template parameter
is `class' or `typename' (since C++17); libstdc++'s C++23 <ranges> uses
`template<template<typename...> typename _Cont, ...>'.
